error BYN2781: `xs` is used after it was moved

  13 │     consume(move xs);
     │             ^^^^^^^ an `errdefer` on line 12 uses it at scope exit
     │
  help: move `xs` before the `errdefer`, or move a `.copy(to: alloc)` of it instead

